       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VALIDATE-ACCOUNT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-IDX PIC 9(3) COMP-5.

LINKAGE SECTION.

01 LK-ACCOUNT-NO PIC X(10).

01 LK-ACCOUNT-COUNT PIC 9(3) COMP-5.

01 LK-ACCOUNT-TABLE.
   05 LK-ACCOUNT-ENTRY OCCURS 100 TIMES.
      10 LK-TABLE-ACCOUNT-NO PIC X(10).
      10 LK-TABLE-CUSTOMER PIC X(20).
      10 LK-TABLE-BALANCE PIC 9(7)V99.

01 LK-ACCOUNT-STATUS PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-ACCOUNT-NO
    LK-ACCOUNT-COUNT
    LK-ACCOUNT-TABLE
    LK-ACCOUNT-STATUS.

    MOVE "N" TO LK-ACCOUNT-STATUS

    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL WS-IDX > LK-ACCOUNT-COUNT

        IF LK-TABLE-ACCOUNT-NO(WS-IDX)
            = LK-ACCOUNT-NO

            MOVE "Y" TO LK-ACCOUNT-STATUS
        END-IF

    END-PERFORM

    GOBACK.

END PROGRAM VALIDATE-ACCOUNT.
